{"4664490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Burger Smash", "steam_appid": 4664490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Save Your Spot For the Beta</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/2b04ac592394ceef14542e10d2006bed.avif?t=1788188009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras_big/2b04ac592394ceef14542e10d2006bed.avif?t=1788188009 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your kitchen, grill burgers, and keep orders flowing in this fast-paced singleplayer cooking game. Design efficient layouts, prepare and serve orders under pressure, unlock unique playable characters with unique perks, and adapt to demanding customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your Kitchen, Your Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/ff7b332a1f548946ef804a5b6706a139.poster.avif?t=1788188009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/ff7b332a1f548946ef804a5b6706a139.webm?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/ff7b332a1f548946ef804a5b6706a139.mp4?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a plan? Good. The orders won't wait. Place your counters, set up your flow, and hope you put the grill in the right spot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Too hot to stop!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/fd6f048a559f720a521e227384963b0f.poster.avif?t=1788188009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/fd6f048a559f720a521e227384963b0f.webm?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/fd6f048a559f720a521e227384963b0f.mp4?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail enough orders in a row and your counter catches fire. Keep the streak alive and watch the tips stack up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Someone Special Just Arrived</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/c953489afae5a9b843717b5726daa48b.poster.avif?t=1788188009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/c953489afae5a9b843717b5726daa48b.webm?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/c953489afae5a9b843717b5726daa48b.mp4?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every customer is ordinary. Earn your reputation across the city and unlock VIP guests who pay top dollar..... if you can handle the pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The City Never Stops Eating</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/dbfd0cab207d4739f100c95e2c3216cf.poster.avif?t=1788188009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/dbfd0cab207d4739f100c95e2c3216cf.webm?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/dbfd0cab207d4739f100c95e2c3216cf.mp4?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beach levels to rooftop kitchens.... each zone brings new kitchens, new customers, and new challenges. How far can you take your burger empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your kitchen, grill burgers, and keep orders flowing in this fast-paced singleplayer cooking game. Design efficient layouts, prepare and serve orders under pressure, unlock unique playable characters with unique perks, and adapt to demanding customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your Kitchen, Your Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/ff7b332a1f548946ef804a5b6706a139.poster.avif?t=1788188009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/ff7b332a1f548946ef804a5b6706a139.webm?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664490/extras/ff7b332a1f548946ef804a5b6706a139.mp4?t=1788188009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a plan? Good. The orders won't wait. Place your counters, set up your flow, and hope you put the grill in the right spot.</p><h2 class=\"b